stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued : Request created, credit held
  queued --> processing : Worker picks job
  processing --> succeeded : Result persisted, credit consumed
  processing --> failed : Error after retries / timeout, credit released
  processing --> blocked : Content safety / keyword block, credit released
  queued --> failed : Enqueue failed or stale job
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  blocked --> [*]
